{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "2f97746b-bed4-418b-b55b-1c0005a62c3c",
    "name": "AISafe - airport-service (SIDIS A1)",
    "description": "Distributed tests for airport-service: 2 replicas (8091, 8092).\n\n1. Generate certificates (AISafe/scripts/gen-certs) and start both replicas.\n2. Postman > Settings > General: turn OFF 'SSL certificate verification' (self-signed certificate).\n3. Fill the token variables with: python AISafe/scripts/dev-token.py --roles ATCC (and BACKOFFICE) - or with tokens from auth-service.\n4. Run folders 0-4 with both replicas up; stop airport-2 and run folder 5.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Health",
      "item": [
